---
import CaseStudyLayout from '../../../layouts/CaseStudyLayout.astro';
import { pageUrl } from '../../../lib/site';

const lang = 'en' as const;
const canonical = pageUrl('/en/realizacja-doraco-hala-tvp/');
const pageScriptsHtml = "<script>\n(function(){var f=document.querySelector('.cs-film__frame');if(!f)return;function play(){var id=f.getAttribute('data-yt');if(!id||f.querySelector('iframe'))return;var i=document.createElement('iframe');i.src='https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/'+id+'?autoplay=1&rel=0&modestbranding=1&playsinline=1';i.allow='autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture';i.setAttribute('allowfullscreen','');f.appendChild(i);}f.addEventListener('click',play);f.addEventListener('keydown',function(e){if(e.key==='Enter'||e.key===' '){e.preventDefault();play();}});})();\n</script>";
---

<CaseStudyLayout
  lang={lang}
  title="DORACO · TVP film studio hall · Film and photo · SEZMOO case study"
  description="SEZMOO case study: film and drone photography of the TVP film studio hall built by DORACO."
  canonical={canonical}
  pageScripts={pageScriptsHtml}
>
<header class="cs-hero" data-screen-label="Case · Cover">
  <div class="cs-hero__media"><img src="/assets/portfolio/doraco-tvp/doraco-hala-zdjeciowa-tvp-zdjecia-z-drona-01.jpg" alt="TVP film studio hall built by DORACO – drone photo" /></div>
  <div class="cs-hero__hud"><span class="rec">FILM · PHOTO</span><span>DRONE</span><span>CONSTRUCTION / PL</span></div>
  <div class="cs-hero__inner shell">
    <a class="cs-hero__back" href="/en/portfolio-en/">← Portfolio / Work</a>
    <span class="eyebrow cs-hero__cat"><span class="tick"></span>SEZMOO × DORACO · TVP film studio hall</span>
    <h1 class="cs-title">DORACO<br><span class="accent">× TVP.</span></h1>
    <p class="cs-hero__sub">Film and drone photography for <b>DORACO</b>, general contractor of a film studio hall for Polish Television (TVP). Project documentation that shows the scale and precision of the build.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="cs-scroll" aria-hidden="true"><span>SCROLL</span><i></i></div>
</header>

<section class="cs-meta" aria-label="Project details">
  <div class="shell"><div class="cs-meta__grid">
    <div class="cs-meta__cell"><div class="cs-meta__k">Client</div><div class="cs-meta__v">DORACO<small>General contractor</small></div></div>
    <div class="cs-meta__cell"><div class="cs-meta__k">Industry</div><div class="cs-meta__v">Construction<small>Large-scale</small></div></div>
    <div class="cs-meta__cell"><div class="cs-meta__k">Project</div><div class="cs-meta__v">Studio hall<small>Polish Television</small></div></div>
    <div class="cs-meta__cell"><div class="cs-meta__k">Scope</div><div class="cs-meta__v">Film + photo<small>Drone · Ground</small></div></div>
    <div class="cs-meta__cell"><div class="cs-meta__k">Goal</div><div class="cs-meta__v">Showcase<small>Reference</small></div></div>
  </div></div>
</section>

<section class="cs-sec" data-screen-label="PROJECT">
  <div class="shell"><div class="cs-intro__grid">
    <div class="reveal"><span class="cs-sec__no">PROJECT</span><h2 class="cs-sec__title">A build that<br>deserves to be <span class="accent">seen.</span></h2></div>
    <div class="cs-body reveal" data-d="1"><p>A film studio hall for TVP is an unusual building: huge volume, demanding acoustics and studio technology. For DORACO it is a strong reference – as long as it can be shown well.</p><p>We produced a film and a photo series from the air and the ground. The material shows the building as a whole and in detail, and DORACO uses it in proposals, on its website and on social media.</p></div>
  </div></div>
</section>

<section class="cs-sec" style="padding-top:0" data-screen-label="THE APPROACH">
  <div class="shell">
    <span class="cs-sec__no reveal">THE APPROACH</span>
    <h2 class="cs-sec__title reveal">From plan<br>to <span class="accent">final cut.</span></h2>
    <div class="cs-steps">
      <div class="cs-step reveal"><span class="cs-step__no">W1, 01</span><h3 class="cs-step__title">Shot plan</h3><p class="cs-step__desc">Shots planned around the structure and the light to capture the scale of the building and its setting.</p></div>
      <div class="cs-step reveal"><span class="cs-step__no">W1, 02</span><h3 class="cs-step__title">Drone</h3><p class="cs-step__desc">Flyovers and top-down shots that show the full shape of the building.</p></div>
      <div class="cs-step reveal"><span class="cs-step__no">W1, 03</span><h3 class="cs-step__title">Ground shots</h3><p class="cs-step__desc">Structural details, the interior and the crew at work.</p></div>
      <div class="cs-step reveal"><span class="cs-step__no">W1, 04</span><h3 class="cs-step__title">Edit and photos</h3><p class="cs-step__desc">A showcase film and selected photos ready for proposals and publication.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cs-sec" data-screen-label="FILM">
  <div class="shell">
    <span class="cs-sec__no reveal">FILM</span>
    <h2 class="cs-sec__title reveal">The TVP hall<br><span class="accent">up close and from above.</span></h2>
    <p class="cs-body reveal" data-d="1" style="max-width:54ch;margin-top:20px">A showcase film combining drone footage with material shot on site.</p>
    <div class="cs-film reveal" data-d="1" style="margin-top:clamp(30px,4vh,48px)">
      <div class="cs-film__frame" data-cursor="play" data-yt="phXKtUNlDuM" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Play the DORACO film – TVP studio hall">
        <img src="https://i.ytimg.com/vi/phXKtUNlDuM/maxresdefault.jpg" alt="Play the DORACO film – TVP studio hall" />
        <div class="cs-film__play"><span class="cs-film__btn" aria-hidden="true"></span></div>
        <div class="cs-film__meta"><span class="rec">● REC</span><span>DORACO, TVP HALL</span></div>
        <div class="cs-film__bar"><i></i></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cs-sec" style="padding-bottom:0" data-screen-label="PHOTOGRAPHY · DRONE">
  <div class="shell"><span class="cs-sec__no reveal">PHOTOGRAPHY · DRONE</span><h2 class="cs-sec__title reveal">The scale of the building<br>in one frame.</h2></div>
</section>
<section class="cs-gallery bleed" aria-label="PHOTOGRAPHY · DRONE">
  <div class="cs-row"><figure class="cs-shot reveal" style="aspect-ratio:16/9"><div class="frame-media cs-shot__media"><img src="/assets/portfolio/doraco-tvp/doraco-hala-zdjeciowa-tvp-zdjecia-z-drona-02.jpg" alt="TVP studio hall from above" loading="lazy" /></div><span class="cs-shot__tag" style="white-space:nowrap">Drone · Top-down</span></figure></div>
  <div class="cs-row cs-row--split"><figure class="cs-shot reveal" style="aspect-ratio:4/3"><div class="frame-media cs-shot__media"><img src="/assets/portfolio/doraco-tvp/doraco-hala-zdjeciowa-tvp-zdjecia-z-drona-04.jpg" alt="TVP studio hall and surroundings – drone photography" loading="lazy" /></div><span class="cs-shot__tag" style="white-space:nowrap">Drone · Setting</span></figure><figure class="cs-shot reveal" data-d="1" style="aspect-ratio:4/3"><div class="frame-media cs-shot__media"><img src="/assets/portfolio/doraco-tvp/doraco-hala-zdjeciowa-tvp-zdjecia-z-drona-05.jpg" alt="Roof and structure of the TVP studio hall – DORACO" loading="lazy" /></div><span class="cs-shot__tag" style="white-space:nowrap">Drone · Detail</span></figure></div>
  <div class="cs-row cs-row--split"><figure class="cs-shot reveal" style="aspect-ratio:4/3"><div class="frame-media cs-shot__media"><img src="/assets/portfolio/doraco-tvp/doraco-hala-zdjeciowa-tvp-zdjecia-z-drona-03.jpg" alt="TVP hall construction – drone photo, DORACO" loading="lazy" /></div><span class="cs-shot__tag" style="white-space:nowrap">Drone · Build</span></figure><figure class="cs-shot reveal" data-d="1" style="aspect-ratio:4/3"><div class="frame-media cs-shot__media"><img src="/assets/portfolio/doraco-tvp/doraco-hala-zdjeciowa-tvp-zdjecia-z-drona-01.jpg" alt="TVP film studio hall built by DORACO – drone photo" loading="lazy" /></div><span class="cs-shot__tag" style="white-space:nowrap">Drone · Volume</span></figure></div>
</section>

<section class="cs-quote" aria-label="Quote">
  <div class="shell cs-sec"><div class="cs-quote__inner reveal">
    <blockquote><span class="mark">„</span>A good reference is one you can see. We showed the TVP hall the way the project deserves.<span class="mark">”</span></blockquote>
    <div class="cs-quote__by">– <b>SEZMOO team</b> · Film and drone photography</div>
  </div></div>
</section>

<a class="cs-next bleed" href="/en/portfolio-en/" data-cursor="link" aria-label="Back to portfolio">
  <img src="/assets/portfolio/doraco-tvp/doraco-hala-zdjeciowa-tvp-zdjecia-z-drona-03.jpg" alt="" />
  <div class="cs-next__inner shell"><span class="cs-next__k">See more →</span><span class="cs-next__title">Portfolio <span class="arrow">→</span></span><span class="cs-next__cat">All SEZMOO work</span></div>
</a>
</CaseStudyLayout>
